{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u25c6Turn fall damage into power</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a random field with height differences, you will repeatedly climb to high places and jump down to low footholds. In this game, falling damage is present, but it can be nullified by activating \u201cAnti-Impact\u201d by pressing the button at the right moment at the moment of landing and kicking off surrounding enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331090/extras/\u7740\u5730\u3057\u306a\u304c\u3089\u653b\u6483.gif?t=1748519650\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u25c6Randomly generated fields</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The field changes every time the game starts. This tests the player's ability to improvise. As the game progresses, more vicious and challenging fields will appear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331090/extras/\u30e9\u30f3\u30c0\u30e0\u751f\u6210\u30de\u30c3\u30d7\u306e\u8aac\u660e\u7528.gif?t=1748519650\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u25c6Dystopian world shrouded in mystery</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a dystopia created by a mysterious organization that exclusively controls \u201csalt,\u201d thoughts are continually measured by a thought tag embedded in your mind.\u00a0You do not get salt because you are not a \u201cpeaceful thinker.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331090/extras/\u8b0e\u306b\u5305\u307e\u308c\u305f\u30c7\u30a3\u30b9\u30c8\u30d4\u30a2\u4e16\u754c_en.png?t=1748519650\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3331090?t=1748519650","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3331